=== Text #1 ===
> To describe clinical aspects of pand[emic (]H1N1) 2009 virus[-]associated[ pneumonia] in[ children, we studied] 80 such[ children, including] 17[ (]21%) with[ complications,] who[ were admitted] to 5 hospitals in Japan[ during] August[-]November[ 2009] after[ a] mean[ of] 2[.]9 symptomatic days[.] All enrolled[ patients recovered (med]ian hospital[ization] 6 days[). Time]ly[ access] to hospitals may have[ contributed to] favorable[ outcomes.]

